{"status":"REVIEW","clause_id":"PAY-ced440770cc67b04b22a","clause_number":"10.3.6","title":"10.3.6.Ceftazidime+avibactam sodium(如Zavicefta): (109/6/1、113/4/1）","source":{"key":"pay","label":"給付規定","status":"REVIEW","error":null,"indexed_nodes":6807,"tables":155,"source_name":"最新版藥品給付規定內容(整份帶走)-115.10.22更新","version":"2026-10-22","announcement_date":null,"page_updated_date":"2026-10-27","effective_date":null,"date_status":"待人工核實，未確認現行有效","verification_status":"REVIEW","pdf_url":"/documents/pay.pdf","pdf_sha256":"5bdd0292a73271c98f7f39afca6971b2bd8fbd4c78a697cd37f43ab78cd1414b"},"pdf_page_start":236,"pdf_page_end":236,"scope":"原始節點及既有子項；非人工驗證完整條文","verification_status":"REVIEW","human_verified":false,"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p007151","raw_text":"10.3.6.Ceftazidime+avibactam sodium(如Zavicefta): (109/6/1、113/4/1）","display_text":"10.3.6.Ceftazidime+avibactam sodium(如Zavicefta): (109/6/1、113/4/1）","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[6152]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p007152","raw_text":"1.限使用於病人有下列條件之一，且經感染症專科醫師會診，確認有carbapenem抗藥性革蘭氏陰性菌感染之可能或明確證據而需使用者；申報費用時需檢附會診紀錄及相關之病歷資料：(109/6/1、113/4/1）","display_text":"1.限使用於病人有下列條件之一，且經感染症專科醫師會診，確認有carbapenem抗藥性革蘭氏陰性菌感染之可能或明確證據而需使用者；申報費用時需檢附會診紀錄及相關之病歷資料：(109/6/1、113/4/1）","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[6153]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p007153","raw_text":"(1)複雜性腹腔內感染","display_text":"(1)複雜性腹腔內感染","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[6154]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p007154","raw_text":"(2)複雜性泌尿道感染","display_text":"(2)複雜性泌尿道感染","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[6155]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p007155","raw_text":"(3)院內感染型肺炎","display_text":"(3)院內感染型肺炎","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[6156]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p007156","raw_text":"(4)其他臨床感染症懷疑為對carbapenem具抗藥性之感染。(113/4/1）","display_text":"(4)其他臨床感染症懷疑為對carbapenem具抗藥性之感染。(113/4/1）","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[6157]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p007157","raw_text":"2.在經感染症專科醫師會診確認使用者，以經驗療法使用後細菌培養結果，若非對carbapenem具抗藥性，則限定使用7天。(113/4/1）","display_text":"2.在經感染症專科醫師會診確認使用者，以經驗療法使用後細菌培養結果，若非對carbapenem具抗藥性，則限定使用7天。(113/4/1）","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[6158]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p007158","raw_text":"3.使用不得超過14天，如因臨床需要而確有延長治療之必要，需經感染科醫師再照會評估認可，且照會紀錄應留存病歷備查。(113/4/1）","display_text":"3.使用不得超過14天，如因臨床需要而確有延長治療之必要，需經感染科醫師再照會評估認可，且照會紀錄應留存病歷備查。(113/4/1）","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[6159]"}],"ancestors":[{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p007089","raw_text":"第10節 抗微生物劑 Antimicrobial agents","display_text":"第10節 抗微生物劑 Antimicrobial agents","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[6090]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p007135","raw_text":"10.3.頭孢子菌素  Cephalosporins","display_text":"10.3.頭孢子菌素  Cephalosporins","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[6136]"}],"nested_tables":{},"references":[],"missing_source_paragraphs":[],"original_nodes":[{"clause_id":"PAY-ced440770cc67b04b22a","clause_number":"10.3.6","parent_clause_id":"PAY-e2f3c2750eb3970702eb","original_text":"10.3.6.Ceftazidime+avibactam sodium(如Zavicefta): (109/6/1、113/4/1）","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p007151"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-da756a09f08ca75c78c7","clause_number":"1.","parent_clause_id":"PAY-ced440770cc67b04b22a","original_text":"1.限使用於病人有下列條件之一，且經感染症專科醫師會診，確認有carbapenem抗藥性革蘭氏陰性菌感染之可能或明確證據而需使用者；申報費用時需檢附會診紀錄及相關之病歷資料：(109/6/1、113/4/1）","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p007152"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-076d2a29e1b516b1c58c","clause_number":"(1)","parent_clause_id":"PAY-da756a09f08ca75c78c7","original_text":"(1)複雜性腹腔內感染","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p007153"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-18065579b90a09992b9c","clause_number":"(2)","parent_clause_id":"PAY-da756a09f08ca75c78c7","original_text":"(2)複雜性泌尿道感染","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p007154"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-03ff92072ee57517d8bf","clause_number":"(3)","parent_clause_id":"PAY-da756a09f08ca75c78c7","original_text":"(3)院內感染型肺炎","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p007155"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-6636ad18cc2203f2e998","clause_number":"(4)","parent_clause_id":"PAY-da756a09f08ca75c78c7","original_text":"(4)其他臨床感染症懷疑為對carbapenem具抗藥性之感染。(113/4/1）","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p007156"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-a184c3f1d54740503657","clause_number":"2.","parent_clause_id":"PAY-ced440770cc67b04b22a","original_text":"2.在經感染症專科醫師會診確認使用者，以經驗療法使用後細菌培養結果，若非對carbapenem具抗藥性，則限定使用7天。(113/4/1）","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p007157"]},{"clause_id":"PAY-5c401d9417a98703baab","clause_number":"3.","parent_clause_id":"PAY-ced440770cc67b04b22a","original_text":"3.使用不得超過14天，如因臨床需要而確有延長治療之必要，需經感染科醫師再照會評估認可，且照會紀錄應留存病歷備查。(113/4/1）","source_paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p007158"]}],"paragraph_ids":["給付規定-p007151","給付規定-p007152","給付規定-p007153","給付規定-p007154","給付規定-p007155","給付規定-p007156","給付規定-p007157","給付規定-p007158"],"table_ids":[]}